  "description": "It’s been a busy year marked by change CHRIS STASSY, one of the highest climbers in this year's poll. For one thing, the summer saw him commence “a new chapter” by switching the U in his surname to an A. That aside, there was the release of his debut LP, ‘Lost, Found & Forgotten...’ and its surrounding album tour. He also managed to host a number of his free party N.A.M.E. shows, took his no-phone event series USS around the world and continued a solid run of releases on his label, Up The Stuss.",
